                                                "sense_id": "a5f02120-8f30-3e00-8ba2-5fe994d60e19",
                                                "text": "Only one [tomb] stone was damaged (the Scaife one), and this took place on Friday, March 2, 1951, as a result of hooliganism on the part of two boys."
